Night Again Demo Is Live!","summary":"Our new game Exit Club: Last Night Again now has a demo on Steam.You go to a nightclub expecting a normal night, but soon realize that the same night keeps repeating.Talk to different people, try different choices, learn something new each loop, and unlock new dialogue options as you slowly figure out what’s happening.It’s a dialogue-heavy game with branching choices, different characters, and a mystery that unfolds as you replay the night.The demo is available now, and you can wishlist the game","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T19:04:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502292","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4862140-1842212951306171","game_id":"steam-4862140","kind":"announcement","title":"New Screenshots & Demo Coming Soon","summary":"Hey everyone!We’ve added some new in-game screenshots and a new GIF to the store page to give you a better look at Exit Club: Last Night Again.We’re still working on the game and polishing things up, but the demo should be ready within the next week.Thanks for following the development and supporting us!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T18:18:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951306171","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4862140-1838407329267333","game_id":"steam-4862140","kind":"announcement","title":"Exit Club: Last Night Again — Demo coming within a month!","summary":"We’re still working hard on Exit Club: Last Night Again, and the demo is getting closer.The game takes place during a night that keeps repeating itself over and over again.We’re planning to release the demo within a month, so follow the game and stay tuned for more updates.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T19:15:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329267333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4862140-1835871199309553","game_id":"steam-4862140","kind":"announcement","title":"Exit Club: Last Night Again","summary":"We're excited to reveal our adult visual novel project: Exit Club: Last Night Again.In this mystery-driven visual novel, you'll find yourself trapped in a nightclub where the same night repeats over and over again. As events begin to feel strangely familiar, you'll uncover new clues, meet intriguing characters, and slowly piece together the truth behind the endless loop.It's still early in development, and many aspects of the game, including story content, features, and pricing may evolve as dev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T15:04:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199309553","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4862140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4862140":"2026-10-26T04:47:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4862140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5157370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4862140","app_id":4862140,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:03Z","source_url":"https://api.steam